<body>
    <h1>LV Data Naming Standards</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>&nbsp;:information:&nbsp;These standards do not apply to Guidewi=
re OOTB entities and attributes&nbsp;in DataHub, naming of objects within t=
hose applications should follow Guidewire Standards and Best Practices. The=
se standards should be applied to any LV entity or attribute extensions.</p=
>
<p>:warning:&nbsp;Changes to the abbreviations on this page page should be =
reflected in the below ER Studio models:</p>
<ul>
 <li>GW_DataHub&nbsp;(Pioneer MI DataHub Naming Standards)</li>
 <li>LND_Landing</li>
 <li>PBLSH_Publishing (Pioneer MI LV Naming Standards)</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">NOTE: Abbreviations are now being=
 maintained in SharePoint <u><span style=3D"color:#0055cc;"><a class=3D"ext=
ernal-link" href=3D"https://lvchange/td/operational/giportfolio/Team/Busine=
ss%20Change/GI%20Business%20Intelligence/BI%20Development/EDM/Business%20In=
telligence%20Naming%20Standards%20-%20Abbreviations.xlsx?Web=3D1" rel=3D"no=
follow" style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,255);">here</a></span></u></span></strong><=
span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><u style=3D"font-weight: bold;color:#c9372c;"=
><span style=3D"color:#0055cc;"> </span></u><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">=
<strong>and then uploaded to ER Studio. </strong></span></span></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><strong>St=
andard Abbreviations, Acronyms and Phrases will no longer be maintained her=
e, please use the SharePoint sheet or Naming Standards Utility in ER Studio=
 to lookup going forward,</strong></span></span></p>
<p><br></p>
