04%7D&amp;file=3DBusiness%20Intelligence%20Naming%20Standards%20-%20Abbrevi=
ations.xlsx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow=
">here</a></span></u></span></strong><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><u><spa=
n style=3D"color:#0055cc;"> </span></u><strong>and then uploaded to ER Stud=
io. </strong></span></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><strong>Standard Abbreviations, Acronyms =
and Phrases will no longer be maintained here, please use the SharePoint sh=
eet or Naming Standards Utility in ER Studio to lookup going forward,</stro=
